{"id":"comique","lemma":"comique","pos":"noun","rank":4007,"glosses":["comedy","clown (person who acts silly)"],"ipa":"/kɔ.mik/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/77/Fr-comique.ogg/Fr-comique.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"comiques"},"formAudio":{"comiques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-comiques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Qui est ton comique favori ?","en":"Who's your favorite comedian?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"favorite"}]},{"text":"Elle n'est pas aussi bonne chanteuse que comique.","en":"She is not so much a singer as a comedian.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"female singer"},{"g":"that / what"},null]},{"text":"Les scènes comiques de la pièce étaient exagérées.","en":"The comic scenes in the play were overdone.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"stage","l":"scène"},null,null,null,{"g":"room in a house, etc."},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]}]}